WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.540
There are 20 cosmonaut
candidates in total.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.210
Out of 3,000 applicants
from the UZSR army,

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:24.670
these elites were selected for being
the brightest and the best.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.250
October 11th
Space Research City 'LAIKA44'

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:40.020
However, even for these elites,
cosmonaut training is no easy feat.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:47.110
Dear me, those poor souls. I wonder
if that vampire girl will hold up?

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.770
Same Day 5:00 PM

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.240
Irina's Confinement Cell

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:27.480
Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:42.930
The Path to Becoming a Cosmonaut

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:42.970
It's Lev! I'm coming in!

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.970
October 11th 5:10 PM

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.890
Go ahead.

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.190
Morning! It's time for training... Huh?

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.360
You didn't use it...

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.070
Let's start already.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.990
Leave your necklace behind.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.200
Why?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.960
You'll have to take it off
everywhere we go.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.790
It's pretty. What gem is that?

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.090
Don't look. You'll defile it.

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.210
Defile...?

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.800
I'll take it off.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.130
So? What's the training plan?

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.390
The same one as the candidates!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:29.440
We run 12 times around the track
to build up endurance.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.310
Training Center - Athletic Field
Fitness Training - 5,000m Run

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:34.190
It's your first time, so go easy.
Run at your own pace.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.780
Ready...!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.200
Start!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:46.710
Wait! It's not a race! Go all out
and you won't last the day!

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.620
Humans are just slow.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.790
She doesn't wanna listen, huh?

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.960
In that case, I won't let her show me up!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.350
You're going too fast!

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.900
Vampire...!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.200
That was over the top for a warm-up!

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:30.620
I know!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:36.380
Still, she kept up with you! She can
fill in for a candidate, no problem!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:42.550
I was worried training might be
too hard, so that's a relief. But...

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.180
I lost to a human...

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:51.690
Her competitiveness... That could
pose a problem. Right, Anya?

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:54.900
I'm very intrigued by her body!

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.990
It's your first physical,
so let's be thorough!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:11.670
Height, weight, blood pressure, breasts,
hips, butt size, X-ray, and blood test!

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.420
She's all yours, Anya. I'll sit over here.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.420
Training Center - Exam Room

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.540
Why are you staying?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.340
Huh?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:21.630
Would you stay for a human girl?

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.340
No way. But I'm monitoring you.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.430
Get out.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.010
But--

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.220
Get out!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:27.720
But--!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:28.850
Get out!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.480
Human men are so insensitive.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.320
Now she hates me more.

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.240
Whoa! So white and smooth!

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:44.780
Don't stare.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.450
158 centimeters... 43 kilos...!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.740
That's light.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.040
And breasts... 82!

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.080
Don't touch.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.340
A very human reaction! Let's see...

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:03.430
What are you doing now?
Why are you wiggling your fingers?

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:05.680
Hey! Stay away!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.010
Ooh! Don't worry, it won't hurt!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.220
I hope not!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.770
Okay, okay. Now show me
your breasts, please!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.220
You've gotta move your hands!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.980
She's an object...

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.310
Space Food and Bloodsucking

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.780
Dormitory Cafeteria

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.080
Is this toothpaste?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.540
It's space food.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.080
Space food...

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:36.170
Don't expect too much.
Scientists make the stuff.

00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.300
Eat it all! This is training, too!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:55.770
You like it? The stuff tastes awful.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:07:00.610
Since it seems you don't know,
we don't have a palate.

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.860
So you can't taste stuff?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:07.490
Yeah. But we do feel textures,
heat, and cold.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:12.240
Smell and texture matter more than taste.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.410
Wow. Wasn't expecting that.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:23.170
If you eat the same stuff as us,
why are you called blood-suckers?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.800
Don't you guys drink blood?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:35.730
Drinking blood is banned for being
barbaric. I've only done it once.

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:39.150
On my tenth birthday
for a traditional ritual.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.310
Lilitto
Anival Village

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:47.070
I didn't like it, but I had to.
They say it's to remember our roots.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.030
What was it like?

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.450
Delicious.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:59.250
My body felt warm
and I was filled with strength.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:07.920
Before you ask, I don't drink
human blood. It would taint me.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:13.010
If all that's true, I don't get
the whole "cursed species" thing.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:20.650
It's human nonsense. Back during
the plague, they put all the blame on us.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:24.690
Ever since, that's how
they've portrayed us in books.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:31.200
Milk... Are you wondering
why vampires drink it?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.910
Yeah.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:35.410
Because teats are made from blood.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.330
Huh?

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:41.460
Milk's a substitute for blood.
Have you had it before?

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.960
I have.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.540
Yeah?

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:56.640
In space, the ship is controlled at 20C,
but issues could make it hot.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.970
Training Center - Hot Room

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:03.520
This is training to help endure it. You'll
stay in a 90C steam bath for an hour.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:10.070
Maly died due to extreme heat.
If a vampire weak to heat can endure it,

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:14.910
we can assume a human
cosmonaut can survive it, too.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.700
Sorry to keep you.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:17.950
It's okay.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:23.170
Today's schedule is hot room
and load training.

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:21.040
Training Engineer
Franz

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:29.970
People should be asleep this time of day,
and I'm stuck training this filth?

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.250
Training Center Vice-Director
Sagalevich

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.390
N44, I'll go first to--

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:39.770
Wait! Have her put this on first.

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:40.640
Why?

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.060
To restrain the filth.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.610
I don't think she'll run away.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.820
She's just hiding her fangs. Bind her!

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:50.530
Um...

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:51.770
You can bind me.

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:52.820
Huh?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.820
They're just accessories to me.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.290
Got your cross and garlic, scaredy cat?

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.330
You little...!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.710
Vice-Director Sagalevich...

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.210
Enough! Let's begin!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.460
Right.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.520
It's hell in there!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:33.950
N44, give the signal if it's too much.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.320
You stink. Go away.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.920
She's melting.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:47.710
Don't push yourself.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:12.070
W-Water!

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:13.610
You hung in there!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.110
That was nothing!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.490
More!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.080
Done, are we? Next!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.240
October 12th 1:10 AM

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.490
Training Center - Centrifuge Training

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.000
Six-G!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:31.800
When rockets launch,
they go against gravity.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:38.090
Passengers aboard feel crushed
by many times their own weight.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:45.600
Right now, Lev is probably nauseous,
in pain, and his body feels like lead.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:50.810
Go for five minutes. Try not to throw up!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.320
Of course, I won't.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.650
Franz!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.230
Huh?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.320
Tighten it!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.950
It already is.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:00.660
I don't care! Tighten it more!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.160
Uh... Right.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.510
Weak! Give her two months
of training in one go!

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:18.090
R-Right.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.270
Up it more!

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.190
J-Jeez...

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.660
This is dangerous!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:47.830
Don't like how I do things?! Well, then,
hit me! Isn't that what you do?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:13:00.590
Today's training is over!
Franz, cleanse everything with holy water!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.760
You okay?! Can you stand?

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:06.510
I'm fine.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.640
Blood! I'll patch you up!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:13.150
Don't worry, it's just chafing.
You'd do that for me?

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:19.650
Of course! Not caring for
live subjects is a researcher's sin!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.910
I'll get the first-aid kit!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:28.580
The color of their blood
is the same as ours.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:34.020
IRINA: THE VAMPIRE COSMONAUT

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.130
October 15th 2:30 AM

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:44.970
Training Center - Pool
Fitness Training - 50m x 10

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:54.770
Not a single complaint yet. Forget
running away; she's giving it her all.

00:13:57.110 --> 00:14:01.820
And she's doing exceptionally.
Research subject? It's more like...

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.070
I'm done.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:07.240
Good work. Has it healed?

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.320
Where are you looking?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.540
Huh? I wasn't!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.500
Like I believe that.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:19.050
Hey, about training...
When do we practice flying?

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.260
The ship? We don't.

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:23.510
Then how do we fly?

00:14:23.510 --> 00:14:27.510
The machine does it all.
You just sit there.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:34.390
We only study to fill out the log
and train our bodies for launch.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:41.780
Oh, but there is one thing.
You've gotta master the parachute landing.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.860
Why?

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.990
There's no other way
to land but a parachute.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.490
Parachute Re-Entry

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:56.080
The ideal re-entry would
be a retrothrusted soft-landing.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:58.750
But we don't have that technology yet.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:04.590
Our plan is for an in-flight ejection.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:11.810
After atmospheric re-entry and falling
to 7km, the whole seat is ejected.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:15.560
It all happens automatically;
the problem is after.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:22.610
You need to detach from the seat
and land safely with a parachute.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:25.990
Nobody's ever done it like this before.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:34.660
You've never used
a parachute before, right?

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.210
Right. I've never flown, either.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:42.460
Two months is just not enough time.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:46.550
It's fine, as long as the seat
is properly ejected.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:50.970
One more thing: she might lose
consciousness on re-entry.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.010
Landing unconscious is...

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.520
Doesn't matter. It's an
experiment to measure risk.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:16:02.230
In other words, it's fine if N44
has a crash landing and dies.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:07.320
Parachute Training Facility

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.740
Parachute Tower - Height 11m

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:20.000
Let's get you used to the height.
Slide down to the bank on the left first.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:21.080
You listening?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.760
Are you scared?

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:31.510
Of course not!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:46.990
The air force academy said this
to anyone who was afraid:

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.820
Tuck your chin or get whiplash!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:49.610
Huh?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:50.610
Go!

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.330
You okay?!

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.970
I'll jump on my own next time,
so don't do that!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.570
Hey!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:30.200
I'm fine.

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:34.700
Are you afraid of heights?
Let's stop for today.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:38.410
The Taste of Soda Water

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:45.750
Just a sec.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.590
Hmm?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.440
Here.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:09.530
What is it?

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.490
Soda water. It's good stuff.

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.990
I told you I can't taste.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:19.200
You'll feel the fizzle, though.
It's invigorating.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.040
That's the best! Try it.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:36.140
Hmm? You afraid to drink it?
Humans chug it.

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.220
I'm not afraid!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.530
You like that?

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:51.810
You tricked me!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.650
Sorry! But it's invigorating, right?

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.950
It was. Huh?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:06.460
Lemon seltzer is good, too.
Tastes real crisp.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.380
Lemon seltzer...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.510
Want some?

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:16.010
Nope! Let's hurry back
before the sun rises!

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:03.720
I said I didn't want it!

00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:11.820
Who even drinks this?

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.110
Tasty!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.160
How's your after-shower drink?

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.870
Good, yeah?

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:32.000
Not at all!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.500
It's good with booze, too!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.880
Shut up, human!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:41.640
Don't look! Quit peeping!
Keep out, pervert! Lecher!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:46.770
I don't care about your soda water,
but it's a waste to dump it!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:50.890
True Enemy

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.150
How's the unit coming along?

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:59.240
Less than 50% done. The cargo is much
bigger than a dog, so it's not easy.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:54.440
October 16th 11:58 AM

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.310
Spaceship <i>Mechta </i>Prototype

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:59.320
1st Design Bureau - Chief's Office

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:02.490
How about N44?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.950
No resistance. She's training earnestly.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.580
Picking him was the right choice.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:12.750
But why assign Lev, the reserve?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:16.590
Because of what happened
after the test run of 0.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:24.970
Out of the thousands of people who've
seen my child, only he showed respect.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.670
6 Months Ago

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:30.190
To him, the species difference
is likely a trivial matter.

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:33.690
His demotion wasn't a big deal, either.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:39.990
But violence towards a superior officer
is a code violation, regardless of why.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:43.320
Anyway, keep a close eye on things.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.660
Is something happening?

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:49.250
No, but you understand.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:53.960
When it comes to space research,
our true enemy isn't just the UK.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.960
We have enemies within, too.

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.030
Next Episode:
'Night Flight'
